"components-dialogs)"
msgstr ""
"[Kirigami.Dialog](docs:kirigami;org.kde.kirigami.dialogs.Dialog) и "
"производные — [Руководство по диалогам](/docs/getting-started/kirigami/"
"components-dialogs)"

#: content/docs/getting-started/kirigami/introduction-actions/index.md:162
msgid ""
"[Kirigami.ActionToolBar](docs:kirigami;org.kde.kirigami.ActionToolBar) - "
